#: ../../troubleshooting.md:1
#: e32b37f33e104901ac578a43f5b24730
msgid "When something goes wrong"
msgstr "出狀況的時候"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:3
#: 67e4e8804b89455394f0991c4e1254b6
msgid "The socket will not open"
msgstr "連線打不開"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:5
#: fb234f810a954c498549a2a64efcb0ba
msgid ""
"The browser tells a page nothing about a failed WebSocket handshake — no "
"status, no reason — so the app asks the service over plain HTTP instead "
"and reports what it finds."
msgstr "瀏覽器不會把失敗的 WebSocket 交握細節告訴網頁——沒有狀態碼、沒有原因——因此應用程式改以一般 HTTP 去問服務，再回報它問到的結果。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:9
#: d27f20c5f49c44a38ceb7f4dbe05f0a3
msgid ""
"**Nothing answering.** The service is not running, or is not where this "
"app is looking. Start it, or set `VITE_WS_URL`."
msgstr "**沒有人回應**。服務沒在跑，或不在應用程式尋找的位置。啟動它，或設定 `VITE_WS_URL`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:12
#: cfe93dc722654a8db20b37c8632707a5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Running, but refusing this page.** The service is up and turned this "
"page away, which is almost always the origin allowlist. Start it with "
"`--allow-origin <the origin this app is served from>`. See {doc}`getting-"
"started`."
msgstr "**在跑，但拒絕這個頁面**。服務是活的，而且把這個頁面擋下來了，幾乎總是來源白名單的緣故。以 `--allow-origin <本應用程式所在的來源>` 啟動它。見 {doc}`getting-started`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:16
#: f09f9cdfd6c9471c8c2bd8519ec652fd
msgid ""
"**Running, and asking for a token.** The service was started with "
"`--token-file`, and this app has none to send or sent the wrong one. Set "
"`VITE_WS_TOKEN` to the contents of that file and reload. The refusal is "
"the same whether the token was missing or wrong, deliberately, so a guess"
" learns nothing from it."
msgstr "**服務有在跑，但要求權杖。** 服務是以 `--token-file` 啟動的，而這個應用程式沒有權杖可送，或送錯了。把 `VITE_WS_TOKEN` 設成那個檔案的內容，然後重新載入。不論權杖是漏了還是錯了，拒絕的回應都一樣，這是刻意的，讓亂猜的人從中學不到任何東西。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:22
#: d99837bbbcf644958290bc5595c1a6b5
msgid "You can ask the same question by hand:"
msgstr "你也可以手動問同一個問題："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:28
#: 0c256d2078b647e89693e191e9c29255
msgid ""
"It answers JSON carrying the QuantLib version the binary linked, its "
"uptime, and how many connections and sessions are open. A reply proves "
"the service's loop is turning; it says nothing about whether a particular"
" graph is healthy, which is the honest scope of a liveness check. A "
"service started with a token reports only that it is alive: this endpoint"
" cannot ask a caller for a secret, so it stops volunteering how much is "
"open instead."
msgstr "它回一份 JSON，帶著這個執行檔連結的 QuantLib 版本、它的執行時間，以及開著多少連線與工作階段。有回應就證明服務的事件迴圈還在轉；它完全不說明某一張物件圖是否健康，而那正是存活檢查誠實的範圍。以權杖啟動的服務只會報告自己還活著：這個端點沒辦法要求呼叫者出示密鑰，所以它改成不再主動說出開了多少東西。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:35
#: c7ff52e9b723423d85440b1e7e8d8725
msgid "\"Overloaded\" when opening a session"
msgstr "開啟工作階段時出現「過載」"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:37
#: 7e5341ab668149df832ad291f1aae7e1
msgid ""
"A socket may hold only so many sessions — sixteen — and the service "
"serves 32 sockets at once. Past the limit, opening a session is refused "
"as overloaded, and the remedy is to **close a tab**, not to retry: a "
"session is a live QuantLib graph holding a worker seat, so retrying is "
"not what frees one."
msgstr ""
"一條連線最多只能持有這麼多工作階段——十六個——而服務同時服務 32 "
"條連線。超過上限後，開啟工作階段會以過載被拒絕，解法是**關掉一個分頁**而不是重試：工作階段是佔著工作者席位的 QuantLib "
"即時物件圖，重試並不會空出席位。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:42
#: 4c09ad9893f143cabb325c14277a8c5c
msgid "The connection dropped — what happens to my session?"
msgstr "連線斷了——我的工作階段會怎樣？"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:44
#: 4caa3d4543764aa5b070043d12e151d2
msgid "One of two things, and the status bar says which."
msgstr "兩種情況之一，而狀態列會說是哪一種。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:46
#: 8a23a104f30d4aa29064abe27f0e17f5
msgid ""
"**socket lost — session held**, then **resumed**. The service kept the "
"session, its graph and anything running in it for its grace window (a "
"minute by default), and the app took it back: same id, same graph, and a "
"calculation that was in flight delivers its result rather than being "
"lost."
msgstr ""
"**socket lost — session held**，接著 "
"**resumed**。服務在寬限期內（預設一分鐘）保留了工作階段、它的物件圖，以及其中正在跑的一切，而應用程式把它接了回來：同一個代號、同一份物件圖，飛在半路的計算會送出它的結果，而不是消失。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:51
#: b46b3c37d6cb49eebb1b02ae98deeff7
msgid ""
"**A new session id, and a bootstrap in the session pane.** The window had"
" passed, or the service was restarted — either way it remembers nothing, "
"so the app replayed the workbook into a new session and repriced. Nothing"
" is lost except the calculation that was running, because the client owns"
" the document."
msgstr "**一個新的工作階段代號，以及工作階段面板上的一次建構耗時**。寬限期已過，或服務被重新啟動過——無論哪一種，它什麼都不記得，因此應用程式把工作簿重播成一個新的工作階段並重新計價。除了當時正在跑的那段計算之外沒有損失，因為文件由用戶端擁有。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:56
#: 44374978509744d1b9ccf8b6330f6f35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A request that was in flight during the drop is held while there is a "
"chance of an answer, and fails as \"the socket went\" once there is not. "
"See {doc}`interface`."
msgstr "斷線期間飛在半路的請求，在還有機會拿到答案時會被保留，一旦沒有機會了就以「連線斷了」失敗。見 {doc}`interface`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:60
#: 1e05c309b60540de886e30f73b2899b0
msgid "A field turned red"
msgstr "某個欄位變紅了"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:62
#: a7f95f24fb9c42d18b78924651939a8e
msgid ""
"Rejections land on the control that produced them, and three kinds read "
"differently:"
msgstr "拒絕會落在產生它的那個控制項上，而三種讀法各不相同："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: b2424dca661a4665b3a435700dc1a258
msgid "Reads as"
msgstr "讀起來像"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 823a4584772e43e6b435e521f23d1ab6
msgid "Code"
msgstr "錯誤碼"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: ec826872f12b4e06bccd5992eaabb821
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "該怎麼做"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 539050c337e64715807d7ef3abee2acd
msgid "*fill this in*"
msgstr "*把這格填起來*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 52d8aa9551fa46258ed51e2b144860cd
msgid "unspecified enum"
msgstr "未指定的列舉"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 5ffb05fae6354088ad65d6eb4f65fdc1
msgid ""
"A required convention was left empty. Nothing defaults silently, on "
"purpose"
msgstr "有一項必填的慣例被留空。刻意不讓任何東西靜默採用預設值"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: f7d73382dfb0411a9ff191bc10474635
msgid "*this value cannot work*"
msgstr "*這個值行不通*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 40fb5c2ea9a8455abe530a926d2f4a90
msgid "invalid argument"
msgstr "無效參數"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 4d8a99ab50084ee6aaa281150391d63a
msgid ""
"The field is set to something the maths or the schema refuses — an expiry"
" before the evaluation date, a lower barrier above the upper"
msgstr "欄位被設成數學或結構描述所拒絕的值——到期日早於評價日、下障礙高於上障礙"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: f177dfbcd0004660a9353d0ec3619eb6
msgid "*this build does not price it*"
msgstr "*這個版本不計價它*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: a0cd778b11e0411a972a722c881112d4
msgid "unsupported"
msgstr "不支援"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 3daa5843d7db4afe9520df05cc12f6bd
msgid ""
"The request is well-formed and this build refuses to price it on a "
"substitute"
msgstr "請求格式完全正確，而這個版本拒絕用替代方案為它計價"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 628b5ed30cb541a6a86cdcffa7e6609d
msgid "*unknown id*"
msgstr "*未知的代號*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: dbf28417dc37422b869edd4ad3cef1e5
msgid "unknown id"
msgstr "未知代號"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md
#: 79a2e4c494b64fe594f52ae865a0666a
msgid ""
"A quote, curve or index id that is not in this session — usually an "
"object renamed after something else named it"
msgstr "某個報價、曲線或利率指標的代號不在這個工作階段中——通常是某個物件在被別人引用之後又改了名"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:72
#: 6d113a2a3e354efd83d803dcbe1987c4
msgid ""
"`BOOTSTRAP_FAILED` means the curve did not strip: check the pillars for a"
" crossing or an impossible quote. `CALCULATION_FAILED` carries no field, "
"because it is not a field's fault — the maths failed on inputs that were "
"each individually legal."
msgstr ""
"`BOOTSTRAP_FAILED` 代表曲線沒能拔靴建構出來：檢查支點是否交叉，或是否有不可能的報價。`CALCULATION_FAILED` "
"不帶欄位，因為那不是某個欄位的錯——是數學在各自單獨看都合法的輸入上失敗了。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:77
#: d8ebcbff00444d4189797ea3ccf1ce5e
msgid "The price did not move when I dragged a slider"
msgstr "我拖了滑桿，價格卻沒動"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:79
#: 747e56a1417c4ee29f7b53b27563502b
msgid "Two known reasons, both of which the interface marks:"
msgstr "兩個已知原因，介面對兩者都有標示："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:81
#: b40cff7dca93414da54a0654098511b8
msgid ""
"**The quote is a fixed leg's rate**, drawn in amber with its slider "
"disabled. QuantLib's fixed-rate leg takes a value rather than a handle, "
"so the rate is read once at construction. Price the trade again."
msgstr ""
"**該報價是固定腳的利率**，以琥珀色顯示且滑桿停用。QuantLib "
"的固定利率腳取的是值而不是控點，因此利率在建構時只讀取一次。請重新為交易計價。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:84
#: 682bf5a0d7394211bba67ca1c187ae5f
msgid ""
"**The edit was structural, not live.** A curve shape or the evaluation "
"date cannot be written into a running graph. The amber bar at the top of "
"the market pane says the structure changed and offers the rebuild, with "
"the last bootstrap's cost in milliseconds."
msgstr "**這次編輯是結構性的，不是即時的**。曲線形狀或評價日無法寫進執行中的物件圖。市場面板上方的琥珀色橫幅會說明結構已改變並提供重建，附上上次建構以毫秒計的成本。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:89
#: d802755000ba453589c80451feb6a327
msgid "A result row says \"not supplied\""
msgstr "某一列結果寫著「未提供」"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:91
#: 83db9a49bef64e309ce399de6e437bf8
msgid ""
"The engine that ran does not publish that quantity — the American "
"approximations publish almost no greeks, and the binomial engine has no "
"vega. It is not zero, and the service names the absence rather than "
"leaving a hole. Price it on an analytic engine if you need that greek, "
"and remember that the two numbers are then from different engines, which "
"is what the engine echo on the face of the result is for."
msgstr ""
"實際執行的引擎不發布那個量——美式近似法幾乎不發布任何希臘字母，二元樹引擎則沒有 "
"vega。它不是零，而服務會指名這個缺席，而不是留下一個洞。如果你需要那個希臘字母，就改用解析解引擎計價；並記得那時兩個數字來自不同的引擎，而這正是結果正面那個引擎回音的用途。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:98
#: 4297c817007741dea04d3b4cd2313135
msgid "The same trade gives two different Monte Carlo prices"
msgstr "同一筆交易給出兩個不同的蒙地卡羅價格"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:100
#: f65202fb4c2741499be666a99f0c2e83
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Expected, and the reason is in {doc}`engines`: batching draws from the "
"random number stream differently from one run of the same total. "
"Reproducibility keys on the triple (seed, samples, batch size). Compare "
"like with like by reading the engine echo on each result."
msgstr ""
"這在預期之內，理由在 "
"{doc}`engines`：分批從亂數流中取值的方式，和同樣總量的一次跑並不相同。可重現性繫於（種子、樣本數、批次大小）這個三元組。讀每個結果上的引擎回音，拿同類去比同類。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:105
#: bf66a1d41e214743abf378e56343a21a
msgid "A capability badge appeared in the status bar"
msgstr "狀態列出現了一個能力徽章"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:107
#: cb8c31871836448b927559d4d5344c82
msgid ""
"The service's `Capabilities` answer disagrees with the tables this build "
"of the app gates its controls on. That means one side has moved — usually"
" a service rebuilt with a new style or result kind. The app keeps working"
" against what it knows; the badge is there so a stale capability is not "
"something you discover by meeting an unexplained rejection."
msgstr ""
"服務的 `Capabilities` "
"回覆，和這個版本的應用程式用來管控控制項的表格不一致。這代表其中一邊動了——通常是服務重新建置後多了新的類型或結果種類。應用程式仍依它所知的內容運作；徽章存在的意義，是讓過期的能力不必等到你撞上一個無法解釋的拒絕才被發現。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:113
#: 9d2abf6d27a541dd9128316a8a4a38c1
msgid "A finite-difference price wobbles as I refine the grid"
msgstr "我加細網格，有限差分價格卻上下擺盪"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:115
#: 241e6a0208a841489fd923985fd26b56
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Two usual causes. If the trade is a barrier, the barrier is probably "
"falling between grid lines — move the asset steps until it lands on one. "
"Otherwise it is the oscillation a Crank-Nicolson-family scheme shows "
"against the kink in the payoff, and a few **damping steps** are the fix: "
"they take the first few time steps fully implicit. See {doc}`engines`."
msgstr ""
"兩個常見原因。如果是障礙商品，障礙多半落在格線之間——調整資產步數直到它落在格線上。否則就是 Crank-Nicolson "
"家族格式在收益函數轉折處出現的震盪，而幾個**阻尼步數**就是解法：它們把最前面幾個時間步改成全隱式。見 {doc}`engines`。"

